        "docs": "Hide the PDF viewer layer without unloading the document.\n\nAndroid and web accept this in any open mode (fullscreen, inline, or underWebView).\niOS accepts it only in `underWebView` or `inline` mode and rejects other modes.",
        "complexTypes": [],
        "slug": "hide"
